  slot 0 ibase.m
ia interface 2 slot(s) inherits ibase
  slot 0 ibase.m
  slot 1 ia.a1
ib interface 2 slot(s) inherits ibase
  slot 0 ibase.m
  slot 1 ib.b1
ic interface 4 slot(s) inherits ia, ib
